<title>MEXICO: Elektra opens three stores in Guatemala.</title>
<headline>Elektra opens three stores in Guatemala.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Elektra SA said on Thursday it has opened three of its mega-stores in Guatemala City, the first step in the company's plans for expansion in Central and South America.</p>
<p>Company chief exective officer Pedro Padilla Longoria said Elektra plans to open more stores this year in Guatemala, El Salvador and Honduras, and to finish the year with about 30 stores outside of Mexico.</p>
<p>Grupo Elektra is a specialty retailer, specializing in electronics, household appliances and furniture.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
